== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* This ability can be used once per day.
*A successful [[reflex]] [[save]] versus [[fire damage|fire]] results in half damage.
*Damage is rolled once for all [[PvP setting|non-friendly]] creatures in the cone. 
*Though the cone will extend 10 meters from the user, he will attempt to approach within touch distance of a selected target object. 
*This feat's description is only accurate for pre-epic levels. In [[epic class]] levels, the damage continues to increases (by 1d10 for every 3 levels), while the save DC does not remain the same but increases by 1 for every 4 levels beyond 10.

